{"hero":{"id":81,"name":"Celeste","nameRu":"Селеста","className":"hero_unicorn","description":"Даже в мире магии некоторые вещи являются редкими и необычными. И что же делать единорогу? Объявить о своём существовании миру и навлечь на себя браконьеров, которые захотят отпилить твой рог? Или спрятаться у всех на виду на кони-айлендском сайдшоу, где большинство сочтёт твой внешний вид лишь частью представления?<br><br>С годами Ослепительная Селеста стала одной из самых популярных достопримечательностей Кони-Айленда. И хотя аплодисменты от воодушевлённой аудитории приятны, силы жить Селесте придаёт семья, обретённая на работе.<br><br>Русалка Керуба.<br><br>Дуболом Ленни.<br><br>Курокрыл.<br><br>Тед.<br><br>Это были её люди. Поэтому когда Селеста узнала, что один из них продал часть своей души, чтобы покрыть карточный долг, она решила выйти из тени и во что бы то ни стало вернуть душу. Рискованно ли раскрывать свою силу покровителям? Да. Но с этим она разберётся завтра, а помощь её семье нужна сегодня.","descriptionEn":"Even in a world of magic, some things are still rare and unusual. So what is a unicorn to do? Announce her presence to the world and potentially have poachers looking to saw off her horn? Or hide in plain sight at a Coney Island Side Show where most folk would assume her appearance was just part of an act?<br><br>Over the years \"The Dazzling Celeste\" has grown into one of the more popular attractions on Coney, and while the applause from a cheering audience is appreciated; what keeps her waking up in the morning is the found family she's made at work.<br><br>Keruba the Mermaid.<br><br>Blockhead Lenny.<br><br>Chickenwing.<br><br>Ted.<br><br>These were her people. So when she discovered that one of her own sold part of their soul in order to cover a gambling debt, Celeste knew it was time to step out of the shadows and do whatever it takes to get it back. Is revealing her power to The Patrons a risk? Yes. But that's tomorrow's problem... her family needs help today.","lore":"Even in a world of magic, some things are still rare and unusual. So what is a unicorn to do? Announce her presence to the world and potentially have poachers looking to saw off her horn? Or hide in plain sight at a Coney Island Side Show where most folk would assume her appearance was just part of an act?<br><br>Over the years \"The Dazzling Celeste\" has grown into one of the more popular attractions on Coney, and while the applause from a cheering audience is appreciated; what keeps her waking up in the morning is the found family she's made at work.<br><br>Keruba the Mermaid.<br><br>Blockhead Lenny.<br><br>Chickenwing.<br><br>Ted.<br><br>These were her people. So when she discovered that one of her own sold part of their soul in order to cover a gambling debt, Celeste knew it was time to step out of the shadows and do whatever it takes to get it back. Is revealing her power to The Patrons a risk? Yes. But that's tomorrow's problem... her family needs help today.","heroRole":"","tags":["Артистка","Назойливая","Ослепительная"],"heroType":"mystic","complexity":2,"colorHex":"#BBA9E1","iconCard":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/unicorn_card.png","iconSmall":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/heroes/unicorn_sm.png","startingStats":{"max_move_speed":6.2,"sprint_speed":1.6,"crouch_speed":4.75,"move_acceleration":4,"light_melee_damage":50,"heavy_melee_damage":116,"max_health":690,"weapon_power":0,"reload_speed":1,"weapon_power_scale":1,"proc_build_up_rate_scale":1,"stamina":4,"base_health_regen":1,"stamina_regen_per_second":0.18867,"ability_resource_max":0,"ability_resource_regen_per_second":0,"crit_damage_received_scale":1,"tech_duration":1,"tech_range":1,"ground_dash_distance_in_meters":10,"ground_dash_duration":0.62,"air_dash_distance_in_meters":8,"air_dash_duration":0.43,"ooc_health_regen":0},"levelInfo":{"1":{"bonus_currencies":["EAbilityUnlocks"],"required_gold":0},"2":{"use_standa